# AGENTS.md

## Project

- Purpose: package and publish one embedded Codex local marketplace safely.
- Stack: Python, Poetry, and a `src/` package layout.
- Import marketplace data with the repository-only script before building a
  release. Generic installation behavior comes from `marketplace-installer`.

## Quality

Run these commands before handoff:

```sh
poetry run ruff format --check .
poetry run ruff check .
poetry run rumdl fmt --check .
poetry run rumdl check .
poetry run pytest
poetry build
```

## Boundaries

- Never modify a local marketplace outside
  `~/.codex/local-marketplaces/<marketplace-name>/`.
- Validate marketplace data and plugin paths before publication.
- Do not execute embedded plugin code during import or publication.
- Keep `scripts/import_marketplace.py` repository-only; do not register it as
  a runtime console script.
